# Third-party notices of the Chroma executable

The Chroma executable in the ChromaDotNet.Local.Runtime packages contains the crates below, for the platforms win-x64, linux-x64,
linux-arm64, osx-x64 and osx-arm64. The list and the texts come from `cargo about` on the Cargo.lock of the tag of the Chroma CLI,
with the normal dependencies of the `chroma-cli` crate only.

## Crates without a license field

These crates have no `license` field, so `cargo about` does not list them below:

- The crates of Chroma itself, in the repository https://github.com/chroma-core/chroma: chroma-blockstore, chroma-cache,
  chroma-cli, chroma-config, chroma-frontend, chroma-index, chroma-log, chroma-memberlist, chroma-metering,
  chroma-metering-macros, chroma-segment, chroma-sqlite, chroma-storage, chroma-sysdb, chroma-system, chroma-tracing, and the
  other crates of that repository in the executable. They are under the Apache License 2.0 of the repository, in LICENSE.txt.
- hnswlib 0.8.2, https://github.com/chroma-core/hnswlib (commit 6868102bde454dc761136e1994490133a6a026bb): Apache License 2.0,
  the text of which is below.
- jsonpath-rust 0.3.5, https://github.com/besok/jsonpath-rust: MIT License, file LICENSE of the tag v0.3.5:

